    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d716">

                <pb facs="0956" n="850" xml:id="pg850"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The President of Honduras to Minister
                    Merry.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><placeName type="venue"><hi
                                    rendition="#small-caps">Palace</hi></placeName>, <lb/>
                            <placeName type="city"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Tegucigalpa</hi></placeName></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1906-07-21"><hi rendition="#italic">July 21,
                                1906</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Informed of the celebration of peace between El Salvador, Guatemala, and
                    Honduras, I have the satisfaction of congratulating you very sincerely upon the
                    part you have taken in the favorable result obtained. I also request you to
                    present to President Roosevelt the gratitude of the Government and people of
                    Honduras for his friendly and efficient mediation in this affair.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Manuel Bonilla</hi>.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
